WEBVTT

00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:03.237
You only wanted to check one endpoint.

00:00:03.533 --> 00:00:07.163
Not log in, wait for a sync, or pick a plan.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:11.567
Dispatch opens, and you send the request. That's it.

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:15.997
Check every response with a few lines of JavaScript.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:20.497
Run a whole collection once for every row of a data file.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.630
See how your server holds up under load.

00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:27.087
Dispatch writes the docs from your collection.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.680
Pick the look that suits you.

00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:34.247
No account. Your collections stay on your machine.

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:41.283
Dispatch, by OG Crafts. Free and open source, on Windows, Mac, Linux, and in your browser.
